<div class="row"><span class="key">A1</span><span><strong>Sequencer.</strong> The CPU, a uPD7811, runs its original program from <span class="mono">tr909_v4.ic609</span>.</span></div>
<div class="row"><span class="key">A2</span><span><strong>Voices.</strong> The voicing board, modelled part by part from the service notes; the hi-hat, crash and ride play their samples from their own ROMs.</span></div>
